="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1.5 bg-white/15 backdrop-blur-xs border border-white/25 rounded-md text-white text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider leading-snug"><span>Confort Superior y Saludable</span></div><span class="text-[10px] text-white/70 font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-black/20 whitespace-nowrap">Sección 3 de 5 • Estándar Passivhaus</span></div><h1 class="text-xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">Tecnología &amp; Principios Passivhaus</h1><p class="mt-2 text-white/90 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">Descubre los principios físicos que permiten a tu vivienda ahorrar el 85% de energía, mantener 20-22 °C constantes y filtrar el 100% de polen y alérgenos.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 mt-5"><div class="bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-xs border border-white/15 p-2.5 sm:p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-4 h-4 text-[#A4E556] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><div class="text-xs min-w-0"><div class="font-bold text-white uppercase text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] tracking-wide leading-tight">Test BlowerDoor</div><div class="text-white/80 text-[10px] leading-tight mt-0.5">n50 ≤ 0.6 ren/h</div></div></div><div class="bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-xs border border-white/15 p-2.5 sm:p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-4 h-4 text-[#A4E556] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg><div class="text-xs min-w-0"><div class="font-bold text-white uppercase text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] tracking-wide leading-tight">VMC Zehnder</div><div class="text-white/80 text-[10px] leading-tight mt-0.5">&gt;90% calor</div></div></div><div class="bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-xs border border-white/15 p-2.5 sm:p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-4 h-4 text-[#A4E556] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg><div class="text-xs min-w-0"><div class="font-bold text-white uppercase text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] tracking-wide leading-tight">Sin Puentes</div><div class="text-white/80 text-[10px] leading-tight mt-0.5">Aislamiento continuo</div></div></div><div class="bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-xs border border-white/15 p-2.5 sm:p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-award w-4 h-4 text-[#A4E556] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526"></path><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"></circle></svg><div class="text-xs min-w-0"><div class="font-bold text-white uppercase text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] tracking-wide leading-tight">Triple Vidrio</div><div class="text-white/80 text-[10px] leading-tight mt-0.5">Gas argón 0.6 Ug</div></div></div></div></div><div class="absolute right-4 -bottom-6 opacity-10 pointer-events-none hidden lg:block"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-tree-pine w-64 h-64 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m17 14 3 3.3a1 1 0 0 1-.7 1.7H4.7a1 1 0 0 1-.7-1.7L7 14h-.3a1 1 0 0 1-.7-1.7L9 9h-.2A1 1 0 0 1 8 7.3L12 3l4 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-.8 1.7H15l3 3.3a1 1 0 0 1-.7 1.7H17Z"></path><path d="M12 22v-3"></path></svg></div></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm"><div class="pb-5 border-b border-slate-200"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase text-[#2F5300] tracking-wider bg-[#E1F7C3] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md">Guía Técnica Clara y Accesible</span></div><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-1">La Tecnología Passivhaus Explicada sin Tecnicismos</h2><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl">Pilares fundamentales que hacen de una vivienda Medgón un hogar ultra eficiente, saludable, silencioso y con una temperatura homogénea todo el año.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mt-6"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300/80 hover:border-[#569900] transition-all shadow-2xs"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#569900] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold shadow-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-boxes w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z"></path><path d="m7 16.5-4.74-2.85"></path><path d="m7 16.5 5-3"></path><path d="M7 16.5v5.17"></path><path d="M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z"></path><path d="m17 16.5-5-3"></path><path d="m17 16.5 4.74-2.85"></path><path d="M17 16.5v5.17"></path><path d="M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z"></path><path d="M12 8 7.26 5.15"></path><path d="m12 8 4.74-2.85"></path><path d="M12 13.5V8"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg uppercase tracking-wide">Passivhaus</span></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3.5">Estructura y Envolvente Hermética</h3><div class="mt-3 p-3 bg-[#F2FBE5] text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-xl border border-[#C5F092] flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="leading-relaxed">Analogía: <strong>"El abrigo térmico de alta montaña"</strong></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Estructura industrializada de madera (LVL y entramado ligero) rellena con insuflado denso de fibra de madera. Garantiza continuidad térmica absoluta y test BlowerDoor n50 ≤ 0.6 ren/h.</p></div><div class="mt-4 pt-3.5 border-t border-slate-200"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Beneficios Directos:</div><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Sin puentes térmicos ni condensaciones</span></li><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Aislamiento acústico superior del exterior</span></li><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Madera como sumidero natural de carbono (CO₂ negativo)</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300/80 hover:border-[#569900] transition-all shadow-2xs"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#569900] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold shadow-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wind w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.8 19.6A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2"></path><path d="M17.5 8a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 2 4H2"></path><path d="M9.8 4.4A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg uppercase tracking-wide">Passivhaus</span></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3.5">Ventilación Mecánica Controlada (VMC)</h3><div class="mt-3 p-3 bg-[#F2FBE5] text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-xl border border-[#C5F092] flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="leading-relaxed">Analogía: <strong>"Los pulmones inteligentes de la vivienda"</strong></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Sistema de ventilación de doble flujo con recuperación entálpica de calor (&gt;90%). Renueva el 100% del aire interior las 24 horas del día sin necesidad de abrir ventanas ni perder temperatura.</p></div><div class="mt-4 pt-3.5 border-t border-slate-200"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Beneficios Directos:</div><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Aire filtrado libre de polen, polvo y ácaros (ideal para alergias)</span></li><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Nivel de CO₂ siempre bajo (&lt;800 ppm), mayor descanso y concentración</span></li><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Ahorro del 90% de la energía de ventilación</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300/80 hover:border-[#569900] transition-all shadow-2xs"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#569900] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold shadow-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-flame w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg uppercase tracking-wide">Passivhaus</span></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3.5">Aerotermia + Suelo Radiante / Refrescante</h3><div class="mt-3 p-3 bg-[#F2FBE5] text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-xl border border-[#C5F092] flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="leading-relaxed">Analogía: <strong>"La climatización invisible y de ultra bajo consumo"</strong></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Bomba de calor aire-agua que aprovecha la energía termodinámica del aire exterior con un COP superior a 4.5. Distribuye calor en invierno y refrescamiento suave en verano mediante suelo radiante.</p></div><div class="mt-4 pt-3.5 border-t border-slate-200"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Beneficios Directos:</div><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Rendimiento energético excepcional (por cada 1 kW consumido entrega hasta 4.5 kW de calor)</span></li><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Máximo confort descalzo sin corrientes de aire</span></li><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Generación de Agua Caliente Sanitaria integrada</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300/80 hover:border-[#569900] transition-all shadow-2xs"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#569900] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold shadow-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-app-window w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M10 4v4"></path><path d="M2 8h20"></path><path d="M6 4v4"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg uppercase tracking-wide">Passivhaus</span></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3.5">Carpintería Exterior Passivhaus</h3><div class="mt-3 p-3 bg-[#F2FBE5] text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-xl border border-[#C5F092] flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="leading-relaxed">Analogía: <strong>"El escudo transparente de triple cristal"</strong></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Ventanas de PVC o aluminio con rotura de puente térmico, triple acristalamiento bajo emisivo con cámaras rellenas de gas argón (Ug ≤ 0.6 W/m²K) y persianas térmicas motorizadas herméticas.</p></div><div class="mt-4 pt-3.5 border-t border-slate-200"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Beneficios Directos:</div><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Eliminación del efecto pared fría junto a las ventanas</span></li><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Aislamiento acústico frente a ruidos de tráfico y viento</span></li><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Ganancia solar pasiva en invierno y control solar en verano</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300/80 hover:border-[#569900] transition-all shadow-2xs"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#569900] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold shadow-xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-200 rounded-lg uppercase tracking-wide">Passivhaus</span></div><h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3.5">Cimentación a Libros Abiertos</h3><div class="mt-3 p-3 bg-[#F2FBE5] text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium rounded-xl border border-[#C5F092] flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="leading-relaxed">Analogía: <strong>"Transparencia técnica desde el primer metro cúbico"</strong></span></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Cimentación calculada de forma rigurosa y ejecutada bajo el modelo de libros abiertos: costes de hormigón, ferralla y movimiento de tierras sin márgenes opacos ni sobrecostes imprevistos.</p></div><div class="mt-4 pt-3.5 border-t border-slate-200"><div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Beneficios Directos:</div><ul class="space-y-1.5"><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Presupuesto claro y adaptado al estudio geotécnico real</span></li><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Aislamiento bajo losa para evitar pérdidas al terreno</span></li><li class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 flex items-start gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900] mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Garantía estructural total coordinada con la madera</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-5 border-b border-slate-200"><div><span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase text-[#2F5300] tracking-wider bg-[#E1F7C3] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md">Simulador de Retorno Energético</span><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-1">Ahorro Económico y Huella Ecológica</h2><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 mt-1">Una vivienda Passivhaus reduce hasta un 85% la demanda energética frente a la construcción tradicional.</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#E1F7C3] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#1D3300] border border-[#C5F092] self-start sm:self-auto shadow-2xs"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-award w-4 h-4 text-[#569900]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526"></path><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"></circle></svg><span>Passivhaus Certificable</span></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300/80 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xs"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#2F5300] uppercase tracking-wide bg-[#E1F7C3] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Ahorro Estimado Anual</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-euro w-5 h-5 text-[#569900]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h12"></path><path d="M4 14h9"></path><path d="M19 6a7.7 7.7 0 0 0-5.2-2A7.9 7.9 0 0 0 6 12c0 4.4 3.5 8 7.8 8 2 0 3.8-.8 5.2-2"></path></svg></div><div class="mt-3"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 font-mono">~1096 €<span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 font-sans"> / año</span></div><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Frente a una vivienda de 87 m² de código técnico estándar (CTE convencional).</p></div></div><div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Factura mensual de clima: solo ~20-35 €/mes.</div></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1D3300] via-[#2F5300] to-[#427500] text-white flex flex-col justify-between shadow-md border border-[#1D3300]"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#E1F7C3] uppercase tracking-wide bg-white/15 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Ahorro a 30 Años</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-5 h-5 text-[#E1F7C3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></div><div class="mt-3"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white font-mono">~44.388 €</div><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/90 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Capital acumulado que permanece en tu bolsillo frente a las facturas convencionales.</p></div></div><div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-white/20 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#E1F7C3]">A 10 años: ~10.960 € de ahorro acumulado.</div></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F2FBE5] border border-[#C5F092] flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xs"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#1D3300] uppercase tracking-wide bg-[#E1F7C3] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">CO₂ Fijado en Madera</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-tree-pine w-5 h-5 text-[#569900]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m17 14 3 3.3a1 1 0 0 1-.7 1.7H4.7a1 1 0 0 1-.7-1.7L7 14h-.3a1 1 0 0 1-.7-1.7L9 9h-.2A1 1 0 0 1 8 7.3L12 3l4 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-.8 1.7H15l3 3.3a1 1 0 0 1-.7 1.7H17Z"></path><path d="M12 22v-3"></path></svg></div><div class="mt-3"><div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 font-mono">~74 Toneladas</div><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 mt-2 leading-relaxed">De CO₂ retenidas durante toda la vida útil en la estructura de madera de 87 m².</p></div></div><div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[#C5F092] text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2F5300] font-bold">Huella de carbono neta negativa en fabricación.</div></div></div><div class="mt-6 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 space-y-4"><div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wide">Comparativa de Consumo y Demanda Energética Anual (87 m²):</div><div><div class="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 font-medium mb-1.5"><span>Construcción Tradicional CTE (~100 kWh/m²/año)</span><span class="font-mono font-bold text-slate-900">~8700 kWh/año</span></div><div class="w-full h-3.5 bg-slate-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full bg-amber-500 rounded-full w-full"></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-900 font-bold mb-1.5"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[#2F5300]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-4 h-4 text-[#569900]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Medgón Madera Passivhaus (~30 kWh/m²/año)</span><span class="font-mono font-extrabold text-[#2F5300]">~2610 kWh/año (-70% a -85%)</span></div><div class="w-full h-3.5 bg-slate-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full bg-[#569900] rounded-full w-[30%]"></div></div></div></div></div></div></main>